  "name": "ECG-FM",
  "alternateName": [
    "Electrocardiogram Foundation Model"
  ],
  "description": "Open foundation model for electrocardiogram (ECG) analysis with 90.9 million parameters built on the wav2vec 2.0 architecture. Pre-trained on MIMIC-IV-ECG and PhysioNet datasets using W2V+CMSC+RLM methodology. Pre-trained and fine-tuned model checkpoints available via HuggingFace. Designed for clinical ECG signal processing tasks including arrhythmia detection, cardiac condition classification, and signal quality assessment. MIT licensed.",
  "url": "https://github.com/bowang-lab/ecg-fm",
